<main class="auth-shell"><section class="auth-story"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-symbol">dk<span>•</span></span><span>Digi-Konek<small>BUSINESS CONNECTED</small></span></a><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT BUSINESS CONNECTION</span><h1>Good products.<br>Great partners.<br><em>Better business.</em></h1><p>The wholesale electronics marketplace that brings suppliers and retailers closer together.</p><div class="auth-graphic"><?= productArt('Components') ?><?= productArt('Networking') ?><?= productArt('Audio') ?></div><div class="auth-points"><span>✓ Verified suppliers</span><span>✓ Wholesale ordering</span><span>✓ One connected workspace</span></div></div><small>A marketplace by TechILO</small></section><section class="auth-form"><div class="auth-inner"><span class="eyebrow">LET’S GET CONNECTED</span><h2><?= $page==='register'?'Build your next connection.':'Welcome back.' ?></h2><p class="muted"><?= $page==='register'?'Create your business account to join Digi-Konek.':'Sign in to your business workspace.' ?></p>
